        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 198, 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Simple Ball Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this solid brass, Simple Ball Knob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Simple Ball Knobset is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. The Ball Door Knob has an Art Deco vibe jut perfect for retro homes anywhere. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ball Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 198 Ball Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3-1/84\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Ball Knob",
                "description": "Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this solid brass, Simple Ball Knob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Simple Ball Knobset is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. The Ball Door Knob has an Art Deco vibe jut perfect for retro homes anywhere. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
